{"text":"This hole in the mud is the reason you're alive. You dug it with a dinosaur bone, on a day when the sky was about to fall. It held when the ground shook. It hid you when the fire came. Its stone door kept a T. rex outside, breathing, all night. You've slept here for ninety nights. Pip has slept on your neck for most of them. You run your hand over the wall. The tally marks. The list. Friends: one… and one more.","mood":"sad","settings":{"stability":0.4,"style":0.7,"speed":1.02},"alignment":{"characters":["T","h","i","s"," ","h","o","l","e"," ","i","n"," ","t","h","e"," ","m","u","d"," ","i","s"," ","t","h","e"," ","r","e","a","s","o","n"," ","y","o","u","'","r","e"," ","a","l","i","v","e","."," ","Y","o","u"," ","d","u","g"," ","i","t"," ","w","i","t","h"," ","a"," ","d","i","n","o","s","a","u","r"," ","b","o","n","e",","," ","o","n"," ","a"," ","d","a","y"," ","w","h","e","n"," ","t","h","e"," ","s","k","y"," ","w","a","s"," ","a","b","o","u","t"," ","t","o"," ","f","a","l","l","."," ","I","t"," ","h","e","l","d"," ","w","h","e","n"," ","t","h","e"," ","g","r","o","u","n","d"," ","s","h","o","o","k","."," ","I","t"," ","h","i","d"," ","y","o","u"," ","w","h","e","n"," ","t","h","e"," ","f","i","r","e"," ","c","a","m","e","."," ","I","t","s"," ","s","t","o","n","e"," ","d","o","o","r"," ","k","e","p","t"," ","a"," ","T","."," ","r","e","x"," ","o","u","t","s","i","d","e",","," ","b","r","e","a","t","h","i","n","g",","," ","a","l","l"," ","n","i","g","h","t","."," ","Y","o","u","'","v","e"," ","s","l","e","p","t"," ","h","e","r","e"," ","f","o","r"," ","n","i","n","e","t","y"," ","n","i","g","h","t","s","."," ","P","i","p"," ","h","a","s"," ","s","l","e","p","t"," ","o","n"," ","y","o","u","r"," ","n","e","c","k"," ","f","o","r"," ","m","o","s","t"," ","o","f"," ","t","h","e","m","."," ","Y","o","u"," ","r","u","n"," ","y","o","u","r"," ","h","a","n","d"," ","o","v","e","r"," ","t","h","e"," ","w","a","l","l","."," ","T","h","e"," ","t","a","l","l","y"," ","